    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire city police force is unable to stop the maniac. An ordinary police officer was tasked with cleaning up the bodies on the streets, but his nerves were not so strong. He began to commit atrocities with a chainsaw in his hands, attacking everyone around him. He is trying to repeat the path of the antihero he was hunting. he is trying to repeat the path of the maniac. You will have to try on the role of a police officer who has gone crazy, who cruelly deals with people and his colleagues. This will not be an easy path, full of dangers. Attack passers-by with a chainsaw, use firearms...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > But remember, the police and local bandits will not give up without a fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game genre - survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless hordes of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different locations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
